 as \"sent,\" even though the reversal was confirmed. That could just be a delay, since the list was also slow to show PAY0001. I didn't reverse again because that could cause more problems.\n\nSomeone in Treasury or Finance should check the bank records:\n1. PAY0001 ($7,401.36, wire) stays in place as the payment.\n2. PAY0002 should show as reversed. If $14,802.72 actually left the account, the extra $7,401.36 needs to be recovered from Delta Printworks.", "type": "text"}]}]}